*.pdb

*.log

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/


# Added by cargo

/target

# Serena + tokensave
.serena
.tokensave

# Python packaging / local dev
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
python/mq-bridge-py/.venv/
python/mq-bridge-py/dist/

.vscode/
.DS_Store
# Both .cargo/config.toml files are tracked on purpose: the root one applies to
# every build started from the repository root (CI, Docker), the app one to
# app-cwd builds. Don't add .cargo/ back to this file.
